+++ b/forge-gui/res/cardsfolder/s/springleaf_drum.txt
@@ -2,5 +2,4 @@ Name:Springleaf Drum
 ManaCost:1
 Types:Artifact
 A:AB$ Mana | Cost$ T tapXType<1/Creature> | Produced$ Any | SpellDescription$ Add one mana of any color.
-AI:RemoveDeck:All
 Oracle:{T}, Tap an untapped creature you control: Add one mana of any color.
